*.user

# Local workflow evidence; not part of the public repository.
/STATUS.md
/Tests/Audit-artifacts.json

# System
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Windows folder icons: Art/ModIcon.ico and Art/Preview.ico are local Explorer conveniences, and
# Steam uploads Mod/ exactly as it stands, so neither an .ico nor a desktop.ini may ever be tracked.
*.ico

# Compiled DirectDraw textures. Never tracked here: a .dds is a build product of a PNG source,
# and it is large. If one ever appears (game caches, tool output), it stays on disk.
*.dds

# Pickle run evidence (captures, films, reports, logs) stays on disk and out of git: it can reach
# gigabytes and the disk is short. What is committed is one text line per run in docs/runs/.
# Which files to keep after a run is in TESTING.md, "Evidence to keep".
/Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
/Tests/Pickle/runs/
/evidence/
